{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "28fcece0c6da9154bba62b4bc5129ee0a5089552e2c5c91949cbc2a3982c18c5", "ja": "（先日、39プロジェクトのアイドル達の\nセンター公演が終わった。さて、次は……）", "zh": "（前几天，39PROJECT偶像们的Center公演结束了。\n那么，接下来是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "493f91cad12ddd376ac75fa23b688f9c625921deea87654015e5146c67e21f63", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！　自分、まだ負けて\nないよね？　置いてかれてないよね？　ねえってば～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！本人还没输吧？\n还没被抛下对吧？在问你话啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "037e639098eefe1141ad58bd3c6c80b727c9e4a29f9455f77b639108df815568", "ja": "お、お疲れさま、響、真。\n……で、何の話だ？", "zh": "辛、辛苦了，响、真。\n……你是在说什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "2e81e973608831dabbf83f474e52e38d01640c6a6129e994baaaca32f5bcf0c9", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです！\nもちろん、劇場のみんなの話ですよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n当然是在讲跟剧场的大家有关的事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "2eb841d77a65fbf5efaaa69201820d0ffc7c087675c6c4923ad31517ef67a1fb", "ja": "最近みんな、どんどん力をつけてきてるでしょ？\nそれで、もしかしたらと思って……。", "zh": "大家最近越来越厉害了不是吗？\n所以我们才在想会不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0ab08a317327e2edd27667bee843208a7e7de09565bb3cf21261fb1910412647", "ja": "ああ、そういうことか。なら丁度いい。\n響もみんなと同じ舞台に立ってみないか？", "zh": "喔喔，原来是指这件事啊，那正好。\n响要不要也跟大家站上同样的舞台试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "ce34d2143c46d443d114a87d09b0140e948d5f3eba62f7b30a8fbe123550bea6", "ja": "えっ？　それって……\n{$P$}、もしかして！？", "zh": "咦？意思是……\n{$P$}，难不成！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2ec112a1ac87ac1479d334cf5b0a42f4e009a6abcc7d24072b3710be621b1bed", "ja": "次の定期公演のセンターだ。39プロジェクト以外の\nアイドルが、初めてセンターを務めることになるな。", "zh": "就是下次定期公演的Center。\n这将会是首次由不是39PROJECT的偶像当Center的表演呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "bbd088f4a26928e816bf7ccdc1296da388c34423b652da021d5a73b822b7cf18", "ja": "響が、ここでセンター公演を！？", "zh": "响要在这里办Center公演！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "cc3cfaf8fa92af460f0c90e2f5cf6715a7e5c96d46498a03bdb68a5994fc3df1", "ja": "そう。今まで劇場は、39プロジェクトのアイドルに\n経験を積んでもらう場でもあったけど……。", "zh": "没错，过去剧场虽然是39PROJECT的偶像们\n累积演出经验的地方，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1010_p", "source_sha256": "98cb014f7e2f4cb97122addce365e1874ce0d292530c8d71bd8aa7f607f98e27", "ja": "みんなが力をつけてきた今こそ、響や真も含めた、\n765プロアイドル全員の劇場にしていこうと思って。", "zh": "大家现在已经不同以往，所以我希望让这里变成\n包含响和真在内的765艺能全员的剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "ee23d90a71bdd89b1d93d96d3aa57c4e565fe18d9d90d2944e3e93010adba3ea", "ja": "や……やるっ！　自分、やるぞ！\nやらなくていいって言われても、やってみせる！", "zh": "好……好啊！本人要上！\n就算你说不用勉强，本人也要做给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1012_p", "source_sha256": "584a13b7c326478c318f0d4976a27acc3fd59c4a32d49fba51025284d4a76842", "ja": "よし！　それじゃ、次のセンターは響で決まりだ。\n最高のパフォーマンスを、この劇場で見せてくれ！", "zh": "很好！那下次的Center就决定是响了。\n在这个剧场展现你最棒的演出让大家瞧瞧吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "6ff23a5f8fdc38fa75454664b9d8f9a6468b2a109c3a323247e399826c059ee8", "ja": "うん！　任せてよね、{$P$}。\n自分、ゼッタイ期待に応えてあげるね！", "zh": "嗯！交给本人吧，{$P$}。\n本人一定不会让你失望的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "2a4ce825d1b35feb69aba5c74ba6f624babb9f44a44b4fbb783f6d001287830e", "ja": "いいな～、響！　ボクも劇場のセンター公演、\nやりたかったのに～。", "zh": "好好喔～响！在下也好想要\n在剧场办Center公演喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "3c1714fb0ed71b76c91a2c2a1b7d270b3170ad14fa8d71154f60fc688f9acc5d", "ja": "ちょっと悔しいけど……ま、いっか！\nとりあえず、手伝わせてもらうからね！", "zh": "虽然有点不甘心……不过，算了！\n总之，先让在下帮忙吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "c08b3cd4e8066048179149a1c6fd3c95cb6d2e636a950107941c9923577fd405", "ja": "えっ、いいの？　もちろん自分は大歓迎だぞ！\nいいよね、{$P$}？", "zh": "咦？你愿意帮忙？本人当然是很欢迎啦！\n可以吧，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5f69f2399a4753b731f1a72dea72c870000761333ea4ab079143883983629326", "ja": "もちろん！　真がいれば、響も心強いだろうしな。\nあとは……。", "zh": "当然可以！有真作陪，响应该也会心安不少吧。\n剩下就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "b99858b0d233af43bd9c5ec0e93f2891e69e481fa45ee990e32bd28c2c598f1c", "ja": "はいはいは～～～い！\n私も、響のバックダンサーに立候補しまーす！", "zh": "我我我～～～！\n我也要报名当响的伴舞～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0d9eb30f380a9f7ba3bc8074d4bebf6f8a33c55bffdf0766512a9ac250b04e39", "ja": "アタシも！　響には、アタシの公演で\nいろいろ手伝ってもらったし、恩返ししたいんだ！", "zh": "还有我！响当初在我公演时\n帮了不少忙，这次该换我报恩了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1020_040tam", "source_sha256": "87059d4387cca850fc4a64b3026f5ab7eddca7a87035d3afa9d605e9afbc3216", "ja": "たまきも～！　おやぶん、たまきも\nひびきのお手伝いしたい！　いいでしょ？", "zh": "环也要～！老大，环也想帮响的忙！\n可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1021_p", "source_sha256": "efc221115d3d8e2a725fda2ab138d9e493cf326ed82c0a7c1512a83efc949757", "ja": "……っていうか、3人とも、いつから聞いてたんだ？", "zh": "……是说你们三个，从哪里开始偷听的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "5e7b537a1649d60dec619fb26f4a02f5319421e7fbe11b34f62cad8d4224f312", "ja": "えっとね、最近みんな力をつけて来たってところ！\nえへへ、ありがとー！", "zh": "这个嘛，从大家越来越厉害那边！\n嘿嘿，谢谢夸奖啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1023_p", "source_sha256": "d19543e8cf8628434ba52eab50c2a3a81c3ca7659dbc705fa883536c87fcaa6f", "ja": "そうか。……ほぼ最初からだな！", "zh": "这样啊……几乎一开始就在了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cb851ac235eb3f2594cb5a996e8a8584d289c4ea5b9e4e94beaa9293da9ce71c", "ja": "いや、声かけようと思ったんだけど、\nなんかタイミング逃しちゃってさ～。あはは！", "zh": "唉唷，我们原本也想要打声招呼，\n但就错失了时机～啊哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "ab8eb191e2e86e40d0d6de0edaccac95f301a76b84d4cf55bbe2b96db77ab625", "ja": "あゆむがしーっていうから、しずかにしてたんだ！\nねえ、たまきもひびきの公演に出てもいい？", "zh": "因为步说要安静，环才不出声的！\n欸，环也可以参加响的公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1026_p", "source_sha256": "8484367aef59c500844f1943b260ca1e3e7942b55bce71e557d7cd70acaaca83", "ja": "そうだなぁ。\n響、みんながこう言ってるけど？", "zh": "这个嘛……\n响，你听到了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "3be43f1f3e32819f7e76f053dce31b183d92a33e4d6d7c5ad85993708f6cbb95", "ja": "あははっ、自分のほうからお願いしたいくらいだぞ！\nみんな、ありがとう！　よろしくね！", "zh": "啊哈哈！本人才想拜托你们喔！\n各位，谢谢啦！请多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "109caca5dde09eb52d09dc9305958ad6113b9678ff96fad631b1046a66b32141", "ja": "やったー☆", "zh": "太好了──☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "12fa60a7149d4732a66d1ccaaa097f9a1f5602c0f4caf68167c044dccfca1426", "ja": "イェーイ！", "zh": "耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1031_040tam", "source_sha256": "350ae59064e4801b70c02d308777410fd8f153a269cff22a81662b45c21c694d", "ja": "くふふ……\nひびきのステージ、楽しみだぞ～♪", "zh": "呵呵……\n好期待响的表演喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1032_006mak", "source_sha256": "66ab7c3fbdbf4b265f672b9d3b0f50b67bae1376434aa7c23ff2d47bada2a61e", "ja": "歩と海美と環か……これは本当に、負けてられないな。\n響、いい公演になるように頑張ろうね！", "zh": "步、海美还有环都来了……这下是真的不能输了。\n响，我们一起加油让公演成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1033_013hib", "source_sha256": "4674d715fbb121b09ea1310c335c5b4364afe52f368aa6cc1d019b05ef23b6fe", "ja": "うん！　カンペキな自分が、みんなに\nカンペキなステージがどういうものか教えてあげるぞ！", "zh": "嗯！就让完美的本人，\n让大家瞧瞧什么叫完美的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "aa416ae906e46937335857bc39d9c82801bbb33781d2e5b7be70869365e9570f", "ja": "将来のトップアイドルの実力、\nしっかり見ててよね！　あっははははは！", "zh": "明日顶尖偶像的实力，给本人瞪大眼睛看清楚了！\n啊哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_043_1035_p", "source_sha256": "8715a8d7af00817d70986dccd5eeb778cb6c79c0166844fab565bf6942cd1044", "ja": "（次の公演のメンバーが決まった。このステージは\nきっと、劇場に新しい風を吹かせるだろう！）", "zh": "（下次公演的成员就这样决定了。\n这次演出想必会让剧场吹起崭新的风潮！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
